{"id":"n92529-1-7","stage":4,"title":"계 · 契","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92529-1-7-1","ko":"지수는 친구들이랑 무슨 계를 만들었다며?","zh":"听说智秀和朋友组了个什么互助会？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"친구들이랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계를","meaning":"契，互助会","explanation":"계：契，互助会；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"계","audio":"/audio/e5fc8350e1fcc9ef8a9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92529","senseId":"1","lemma":"계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들었다며?","meaning":"建立，组建","explanation":"만들다：建立，组建；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"6","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"e5fc8350e1fcc9ef","term":"계","zh":"契，互助会","audio":"/audio/e5fc8350e1fcc9ef8a9f.mp3","entryId":"92529","definition":"从古至今为了在经济上互相帮助或增进和睦而建立的组织。","pronunciation":["계:","게:"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"建立，组建","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3",